<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n90114" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρόσταξις</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εως</span>,
			ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>posting of additional troops on the wings of a phalanx,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Ael.
				<u>Tact.</u>
				24.3
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arr.
				<u>Tact.</u>
				20.3
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>ordinance, command,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Lg.</u>
				631d
			</span></i> (pl.), <i><span class="en">
				673c
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προστάξεις προστάττοντες
			ἀνίσους</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				761e
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινὶ τὴν πρόσταξιν
			ποιεῖσθαι</span> to <i>command</i> him, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Top.</u>
				103a35
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Lys.
				2.1
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκ προστάξεως τοῦ κυρίου μου κτλ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>POxy.</u>
					1204.7
				</span></i>
			
			<span class="entity">(iii A. D.)</span>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				1252r
			</span></i>.<i><span class="en">
				19
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iii A. D.)</span>; <i>requisition,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὴν π. ταῖς πόλεσιν ἑκατὸν νεῶν τῆς
					ναυπηγίας ἐποιοῦντο</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Th.
					8.3
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b> at Athens,
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄτιμοι κατὰ προστάξεις</span>
			citizens deprived of their rights <i>in certain specified
				particulars</i> (opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παντάπασιν
				ἄτιμοι</span>), <i><span class="en">
				And.
				1.75
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
